# Environment — do NOT commit any file that holds real credentials.
#
# COMMITTED env files (whitelisted, must contain only placeholders or already-
# public NEXT_PUBLIC_* values):
#   - backend/.env.example          (placeholder template, "change_me")
#   - frontend/.env.local.example   (dev URL guidance only)
#   - frontend/.env.production      (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL only — baked into
#                                    client bundle, already public)
#
# IGNORED env files (never push to GitHub):
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.production
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.test
.envrc
secrets.*
*.secret
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key
!*.public.key

# Build
.next/
dist/
build/